ference is from my self-written homage:\nhttps://archiveofourown.org/works/39556938\n\nIt's morning in the high-class apartment where the two of them live together. Shiroyuki was eating breakfast at the dining table when Mai suddenly sat on top of him and kissed him passionately.\n\nJonouchi was wearing a sleeveless tank top and shorts; Peacock Mai was wearing light make-up on her face, her messy blonde hair was tied up in a high ponytail, and she was loosely dressed in the blue and white t-shirt and shorts that Jonouchi wore in Duel City.\n\nThank you very much for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Sannee/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce1bab69/uploads/origins/af20d6ec-9c1c-4cf4-acdb-d4c5da1a023f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=168270a6e5cb9d82f70e9b2881056265", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ce1bab69/uploads/origins/af20d6ec-9c1c-4cf4-acdb-d4c5da1a023f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=168270a6e5cb9d82f70e9b2881056265, https://si.imgix.net/ce1bab69/uploads/origins/af20d6ec-9c1c-4cf4-acdb-d4c5da1a023f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8d951b2eafe489097ba8587d22805c75 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ce1bab69/uploads/origins/af20d6ec-9c1c-4cf4-acdb-d4c5da1a023f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d19c4c9bcf0ac69ec48997f9b4c1b0f8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello. Please draw my OC.\n\nMy OC's name is Kori-chan. Kori is stubborn and curious. Kori loves strawberries and coffee. Kori is a computer technician.\n\nI love your black and white style work like the ones you post on Tumblr. I would be very happy if you drew her in black and white style!\n\nThank you!\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/90267071_rIDoRVe0ILRNh0C.png\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/90267071_rIDoRVe0ILRNh0C.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Sannee/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1e58979a/uploads/origins/5c737cb2-5b41-4c44-9d4d-806a00beac1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b0ddcbc3b435e49bd6222a063f978bf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1e58979a/uploads/origins/5c737cb2-5b41-4c44-9d4d-806a00beac1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b0ddcbc3b435e49bd6222a063f978bf, https://si.imgix.net/1e58979a/uploads/origins/5c737cb2-5b41-4c44-9d4d-806a00beac1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a12c9fc4712af6d80a7c9c821e6d922 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1e58979a/uploads/origins/5c737cb2-5b41-4c44-9d4d-806a00beac1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc1b23c23047b3e0aa2b520f5c3b0e6a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you! What I would like you to draw is \"遊戯王DM孔雀舞 & 城之內 with a pure love feeling\".\n\nexplanation:\n1. It's morning. Mai Kujaku and Katsuya Jonouchi share a bed. Bed and room design doesn't need to be too detailed.\n\n2. Jonouchi is wearing a T-shirt. Mai is wearing an elegant purple lace nightgown.\n\n3. Jonouchi is sleeping with lipstick marks on his face. Mai is hugging him while smiling at him. Mai: 克也、大好き(pink letters)\n\nThanks for your consideration!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Sannee/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/270867ff/uploads/origins/e5dd1739-b0cb-4344-9321-2eb0cfd1900e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69b3e6c13e872449717c0695e76f2d53", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/270867ff/uploads/origins/e5dd1739-b0cb-4344-9321-2eb0cfd1900e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69b3e6c13e872449717c0695e76f2d53, https://si.imgix.net/270867ff/uploads/origins/e5dd1739-b0cb-4344-9321-2eb0cfd1900e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=we